BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Every landing pad</h1>
A delta-glider is set down on every pad of every base of the solar
system in turn; it must settle on each: landed, level, at rest, where
it was put.
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 51983.25
  Script Tests/BasePadsTest
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship PAD
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET PAD
  MODE Extern
  POS 4.0 -20.0 -30
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 50.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_SHIPS
PAD:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Landed Earth
  BASE Cape Canaveral:1
  HEADING 0.00
  GEAR 1 1.0000
  PRPLEVEL 0:0.050 1:1.000
END
END_SHIPS
